
{ "head": { "link": [], "vars": ["f", "order", "cit", "c", "type", "text"] },
  "results": { "distinct": false, "ordered": true, "bindings": [
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_6/odst_1" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6CAD" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 6 odst. 1" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8670025" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(1)</var> P\u0159es\u00E1hne-li sou\u010Det n\u00E1klad\u016F za drobn\u00E9 opravy uveden\u00E9 v <a data-odkaz-id=\"39317931\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">\u00A7 4</a> a <a data-odkaz-id=\"39317937\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">5</a> v kalend\u00E1\u0159n\u00EDm roce \u010D\u00E1stku rovnaj\u00EDc\u00ED se 100 K\u010D/m<sup>2</sup> podlahov\u00E9 plochy bytu, dal\u0161\u00ED opravy v dan\u00E9m kalend\u00E1\u0159n\u00EDm roce se nepova\u017Euj\u00ED za drobn\u00E9 opravy." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_6/odst_2" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6CAF" }	, "cit": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00A7 6 odst. 2" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8670027" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "<var>(2)</var> Podlahovou plochou bytu se pro \u00FA\u010Dely tohoto na\u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED rozum\u00ED sou\u010Det podlahov\u00FDch ploch bytu a v\u0161ech prostor\u016F, kter\u00E9 jsou s bytem u\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1ny, a to i mimo byt, pokud jsou u\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1ny v\u00FDhradn\u011B n\u00E1jemcem bytu; podlahov\u00E1 plocha sklep\u016F, kter\u00E9 nejsou m\u00EDstnostmi, a podlahov\u00E1 plocha balkon\u016F, lod\u017Ei\u00ED a teras se zapo\u010D\u00EDt\u00E1v\u00E1 pouze jednou polovinou." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_2/frag_8669983" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6B5A" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8669983" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "B\u011B\u017Enou \u00FAdr\u017Ebou bytu se rozum\u00ED udr\u017Eov\u00E1n\u00ED a \u010Di\u0161t\u011Bn\u00ED bytu v\u010Detn\u011B za\u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED a vybaven\u00ED bytu, kter\u00E9 se prov\u00E1d\u00ED obvykle p\u0159i u\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1n\u00ED bytu. Jde zejm\u00E9na o malov\u00E1n\u00ED, opravu om\u00EDtek, tapetov\u00E1n\u00ED a \u010Di\u0161t\u011Bn\u00ED podlah v\u010Detn\u011B podlahov\u00FDch krytin, obklad\u016F st\u011Bn a \u010Di\u0161t\u011Bn\u00ED zanesen\u00FDch odpad\u016F a\u017E ke svisl\u00FDm rozvod\u016Fm. D\u00E1le se b\u011B\u017Enou \u00FAdr\u017Ebou rozum\u00ED udr\u017Eov\u00E1n\u00ED za\u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED bytu ve funk\u010Dn\u00EDm stavu, pravideln\u00E9 prohl\u00EDdky a \u010Di\u0161t\u011Bn\u00ED p\u0159edm\u011Bt\u016F uveden\u00FDch v <a data-odkaz-id=\"39317967\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">\u00A7 4 p\u00EDsm. g)</a>, kontrola funk\u010Dnosti termostatick\u00FDch hlavic s elektronick\u00FDm \u0159\u00EDzen\u00EDm, kontrola funk\u010Dnosti hl\u00E1si\u010De kou\u0159e v\u010Detn\u011B v\u00FDm\u011Bny zdroje, kontrola a \u00FAdr\u017Eba vodovodn\u00EDch bateri\u00ED s elektronick\u00FDm \u0159\u00EDzen\u00EDm." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_5/frag_8670019" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6C6D" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8670019" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "Podle v\u00FD\u0161e n\u00E1klad\u016F se za drobn\u00E9 opravy pova\u017Euj\u00ED dal\u0161\u00ED opravy bytu a jeho vybaven\u00ED a v\u00FDm\u011Bny jednotliv\u00FDch p\u0159edm\u011Bt\u016F nebo jejich sou\u010D\u00E1st\u00ED, kter\u00E9 nejsou uvedeny v <a data-odkaz-id=\"39317943\" href=\"#\" class=\"int_odkaz\">\u00A7 4</a>, jestli\u017Ee n\u00E1klad na jednu opravu nep\u0159es\u00E1hne \u010D\u00E1stku 1 000 K\u010D. Prov\u00E1d\u00ED-li se na t\u00E9\u017Ee v\u011Bci n\u011Bkolik oprav, kter\u00E9 spolu souvisej\u00ED a \u010Dasov\u011B na sebe navazuj\u00ED, je rozhoduj\u00EDc\u00ED sou\u010Det n\u00E1klad\u016F na souvisej\u00EDc\u00ED opravy. N\u00E1klady na dopravu a jin\u00E9 n\u00E1klady spojen\u00E9 s opravou se do n\u00E1klad\u016F na tuto opravu nezapo\u010D\u00EDt\u00E1vaj\u00ED a hrad\u00ED je n\u00E1jemce." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_1/frag_8669975" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6AD6" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8669975" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Nadpis_pod" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "\u00DAvodn\u00ED ustanoven\u00ED" }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_1/frag_8669977" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6ADA" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8669977" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "Toto na\u0159\u00EDzen\u00ED vymezuje pojmy b\u011B\u017En\u00E1 \u00FAdr\u017Eba bytu a drobn\u00E9 opravy souvisej\u00EDc\u00ED s u\u017E\u00EDv\u00E1n\u00EDm bytu." }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_2/frag_8669981" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6B56" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8669981" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Nadpis_pod" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "B\u011B\u017En\u00E1 \u00FAdr\u017Eba bytu" }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_3/frag_8669987" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BD6" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8669987" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Nadpis_pod" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "Drobn\u00E9 opravy bytu" }},
    { "f": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/eli/cz/sb/2015/308/2016-01-01/dokument/norma/par_3/frag_8669989" }	, "order": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "6BDA" }	, "c": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/pr\u00E1vn\u00ED-akt-fragment/8669989" }	, "type": { "type": "uri", "value": "https://opendata.eselpoint.gov.cz/esel-esb/cis-esb-typ-fragmentu/polo\u017Eka/Odstavec_Dc" }	, "text": { "type": "typed-literal", "datatype": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "value": "Za drobn\u00E9 opravy se pova\u017Euj\u00ED opravy bytu a jeho vnit\u0159n\u00EDho vybaven\u00ED, pokud je toto vybaven\u00ED sou\u010D\u00E1st\u00ED bytu a je ve vlastnictv\u00ED pronaj\u00EDmatele, a to podle v\u011Bcn\u00E9ho vymezen\u00ED nebo podle v\u00FD\u0161e n\u00E1klad\u016F." }},
